▪▪ Abstract

This ❲Patent❳❪300000030.md❫ describes a Method to saw ❲Skirting-Boards❳❪17000001.md❫ for Edges.

▪▪ Problem

For rounded Skirting-Boards there are multiple Ways to saw Edges:

❗❲300050004❳❪300050004.jpg❫

This can cause a lot of ❲Heade-Ache❳❪48000005.md❫ for the ❲Human-Brain❳❪40080029.md❫:

❗❲300050005❳❪300050005.jpg❫

